Triergon shape package licensing

The source in this package is available under your choice of MIT or
Apache-2.0. The two complete licence texts follow.

Most modules outside src/bidi are Rust translations of HarfBuzz 14.6.0, or
tables generated from its source files, and the font functions in
src/metrics.rs and the rotation decisions in src/rotations.rs follow libass
0.17.5. Those parts are also under the licence of the project they derive
from: HarfBuzz's "Old MIT" licence and libass's ISC licence, whose notices
follow the two licence texts. The derived modules are listed in
docs/provenance.md:
https://github.com/triergon/triergon/blob/main/docs/provenance.md

The generated tables in src/unicode hold data from the Unicode Character
Database, and src/bidi was written with the Unicode Consortium's C reference
implementation of UAX #9 as its model; THIRD-PARTY.md describes both. The
Unicode notices follow the HarfBuzz and libass notices.

